{
  "_comment": [
    "仓库侧人类维护的 verify 命令 allowlist（R10 §16）。",
    "",
    "'command_roots' 是允许作为命令根的程序名。profile 的 command[0] 必须出现在这里，",
    "否则加载策略时直接失败 —— 这条就是 §16「verify 命令根必须来自仓库侧人类维护的",
    "policy allowlist，Planner 只能填写允许的参数和测试路径」的执行点。",
    "",
    "命令用 argv 数组而不是 shell 字符串：shell 字符串会让 allowlist 变成建议。",
    "",
    "新增根或 profile 必须由人类改本文件；Planner 与 Harness 只能选择已登记的 profile 与参数。",
    "",
    "本机补充：profile 的 command[0] 必须能解析到带测试依赖的解释器。本机 `python`/`python3`",
    "从 Python 进程里 spawn 时解析到 venv 的基础解释器（pyvenv.cfg 的 home 指向 harness 自带的",
    "python，没有 venv 的 site-packages），因此 backend-default 钉住 venv 自己的绝对解释器；",
    "该绝对路径同时登记进 command_roots。"
  ],
  "version": "1",
  "integration_profile": "docs-check",
  "command_roots": [
    "python",
    "python3",
    "pytest",
    "npm",
    "node",
    "go",
    "cargo",
    "make",
    "D:\\study\\tools\\agent\\new agent\\.worktrees\\codex\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe"
  ],
  "profiles": {
    "docs-check": {
      "command": [
        "python",
        "D:/study/tools/agent/new agent/.worktrees/codex/backend/app/verify/docs_profile.py"
      ],
      "timeout_seconds": 300,
      "max_verify_attempts": 1,
      "allow_network": false,
      "allowed_secrets": [],
      "lockfile_mutating": false
    },
    "backend-default": {
      "command": ["D:\\study\\tools\\agent\\new agent\\.worktrees\\codex\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe", "-m", "pytest", "-q"],
      "timeout_seconds": 1800,
      "max_verify_attempts": 2,
      "allow_network": false,
      "allowed_secrets": [],
      "lockfile_mutating": false
    },
    "lint-only": {
      "command": ["python", "-m", "compileall", "-q", "src"],
      "timeout_seconds": 600,
      "max_verify_attempts": 1,
      "allow_network": false,
      "allowed_secrets": [],
      "lockfile_mutating": false
    }
  }
}
